ata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-rivers-lake-centerlines/","note":"River directions and valley anchors; centerlines are not surveyed medieval channels or settlement locations."}],"kind":"piecewise-resource-terrain-mosaic","profileId":"west-siberian-oghur","componentNames":["Ishim forest-steppe terrace and pasture chain","Irtysh western Siberian terrace margins"],"resourceKinds":["river-forest-steppe","river-terrace"],"constraints":{"landClip":"Retained Natural Earth land polygons, no offshore tolerance","channelClearanceKm":0.45,"terrainMethod":"Named coarse exclusion polygons and positive river/foothill/oasis envelopes; no elevation raster","exclusionReasons":[{"name":"Western Siberian peat/mire core north of source terraces","reason":"Coarse major wetland/channel-core avoidance; nearby terraces and levee margins remain eligible.","ring":[[67,55.5],[72,55.3],[73,57],[67,57],[67,55.5]]}]},"profiles":[{"id":"turkic-landscape-v2:ishim-oghur","label":"Ishim forest-steppe terrace and pasture chain","share":0.65,"kind":"river-forest-steppe","footprint":[[66.36695859484632,53.64121579409529],[67.78507709128809,54.27845264519895],[69.37302639219278,54.55942258068583],[70.93761766554799,54.657772373576535],[71.06238233445201,54.342227626423465],[69.62697360780722,54.04057741931416],[68.21492290871191,53.72154735480105],[66.63304140515368,53.35878420590471],[66.36695859484632,53.64121579409529]],"corridors":[{"path":[[66.5,53.5],[68,54],[69.5,54.3],[71,54.5]],"widthKm":15.5,"weight":1}],"resources":[],"background":0.006,"exclusions":[[[67,55.5],[72,55.3],[73,57],[67,57],[67,55.5]]]},{"id":"turkic-landscape-v2:irytsh-oghur","label":"Irtysh western Siberian terrace margins","share":0.35,"kind":"river-terrace","footprint":[[71.81869752489955,53.09380624304335],[72.67430529099012,53.875614388610735],[73.81218381988155,54.406592050860716],[74.18781618011845,54.19340794913928],[73.32569470900988,53.52438561138927],[72.18130247510045,52.90619375695665],[71.81869752489955,