ated ground follows the component polygons.  No source text, people, demographic prior, parent debit or chronology is changed.","sources":[{"title":"Natural Earth 1:10m land polygons, retained local geometry","url":"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-land/","note":"Present land/water clipping only; historical shores and resource abundance are not inferred."},{"title":"Natural Earth 1:10m rivers and lake centerlines, retained local geometry","url":"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-rivers-lake-centerlines/","note":"River directions and valley anchors; centerlines are not surveyed medieval channels or settlement locations."}],"kind":"piecewise-resource-terrain-mosaic","profileId":"azerbaijan-frontier","componentNames":["Tabriz–Ahar basin and lower foothills","Mughan–Aras terrace and pasture strip","Ardabil seasonal foothill pasture","Bayburt–Erciş eastern Anatolian basin/pasture chain","Âmid upper Tigris basin/foothill pasture"],"resourceKinds":["basin-foothill","river-pasture","foothill-pasture","intermontane-pasture","river-foothill"],"constraints":{"landClip":"Retained Natural Earth land polygons, no offshore tolerance","channelClearanceKm":0.45,"terrainMethod":"Named coarse exclusion polygons and positive river/foothill/oasis envelopes; no elevation raster","exclusionReasons":[{"name":"Lake Urmia water/saline core","reason":"Coarse major wetland/channel-core avoidance; nearby terraces and levee margins remain eligible.","ring":[[45.1,37],[46,37.3],[45.9,38.2],[45.2,38.2],[45.1,37]]},{"name":"Sahand summit core","reason":"Coarse rugged summit/ridge-core avoidance, not a numerical elevation or slope model.","ring":[[46,37.5],[46.6,37.5],[46.7,37.85],[46.1,37.9],[46,37.5]]},{"name":"Sabalan summit core","reason":"Coarse rugged summit/ridge-core avoidance, not a numerical elevation or slope model.","ring":[[47.5,38.15],[47.9,38.15],[47.95,38.45],[47.6,38.5],[47.5,38.15]]}]},"profiles":[{"id":"turkic-la