ent polygons.  No source text, people, demographic prior, parent debit or chronology is changed.","sources":[{"title":"Natural Earth 1:10m land polygons, retained local geometry","url":"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-land/","note":"Present land/water clipping only; historical shores and resource abundance are not inferred."},{"title":"Natural Earth 1:10m rivers and lake centerlines, retained local geometry","url":"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-rivers-lake-centerlines/","note":"River directions and valley anchors; centerlines are not surveyed medieval channels or settlement locations."}],"kind":"piecewise-resource-terrain-mosaic","profileId":"central-anatolia","componentNames":["Konya basin seasonal water/pasture margins","Ankara–Sakarya lower plateau water belt","Kızılırmak terrace/pasture bend","Sivas basin and foothill pasture"],"resourceKinds":["basin-pasture","river-plateau"],"constraints":{"landClip":"Retained Natural Earth land polygons, no offshore tolerance","channelClearanceKm":0.45,"terrainMethod":"Named coarse exclusion polygons and positive river/foothill/oasis envelopes; no elevation raster","exclusionReasons":[{"name":"Tuz Gölü saline/lake core","reason":"Coarse major wetland/channel-core avoidance; nearby terraces and levee margins remain eligible.","ring":[[32.8,38.4],[33.6,38.3],[33.7,39.1],[33,39.1],[32.8,38.4]]},{"name":"Taurus high crest","reason":"Coarse rugged summit/ridge-core avoidance, not a numerical elevation or slope model.","ring":[[32.3,36.8],[35.3,37],[35.6,37.4],[32.5,37.3],[32.3,36.8]]}]},"profiles":[{"id":"turkic-landscape-v2:konya","label":"Konya basin seasonal water/pasture margins","share":0.35,"kind":"basin-pasture","footprint":[[31.545208571058282,37.83720533854457],[32.268074820124056,38.18750295154507],[32.91976694600481,38.24905698266512],[33.08023305399519,37.950943017334886],[32.53192517987594,37.61249704845493],[31.65479142894172,37.562794661455435